ts you with nature and allows you to enjoy the beauty of the landscape in all its splendor.<br \/>\nSo that you don&#8217;t miss this spectacle, in this post we are going to reveal the 9 best viewpoints to see the sunset in Menorca. Don&#8217;t miss them!  <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1,97],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-908","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-sin-categoria","category-sunsets-in-menorca"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v28.3 (Yoast SEO v28.8) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Sunsets in Menorca<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The 9 best viewpoints to watch the sunset in Menorca: lighthouses and cliffs with tips from a local guide.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/sunset-menorca-9-viewpoints\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Sunsets in Menorca\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The 9 best viewpoints to watch the sunset in Menorca: lighthouses and cliffs with tips from a local guide.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/sunset-menorca-9-viewpoints\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Guided Tours in Menorca\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-11T18:30:24+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-07-02T11:52:51+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/pont-den-gil.webp\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\